3. MARKDOWN OBSIDIAN SUPPORTS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  # H1 .. ###### H6
  **bold**   *italic*   ***bold italic***   ~~strikethrough~~
  ==highlight==
  `inline code`
  %%this is a comment, invisible in reading view%%
  %%
  multi-line comment
  %%
 
  > blockquote
  ---            horizontal rule (also *** or ___)
 
  - unordered list
    - nested (indent 2 or 4 spaces, be consistent)
  1. ordered list
  - [ ] open task
  - [x] done task
  - [/] custom state (renders only with a theme/plugin that styles it)
 
  Tables:
    | Col A | Col B |
    | ----- | ----: |
    | val   |    42 |
 
  Fenced code:
    ```bash
    rsync -avh --progress src/ dst/
    ```
 
  Mermaid diagrams:
    ```mermaid
    graph TD
      A[NAS] --> B[DobiMigrate]
      B --> C[FSx for ONTAP]
    ```
 
  Math (MathJax):
    inline $E = mc^2$
    block   $$\sum_{i=1}^{n} i$$
 
  Footnotes:
    Some claim.[^1]
    [^1]: The supporting detail.
 
    Inline footnote: Some claim.^[the detail right here]
 
  Escaping: backslash a character to keep it literal, e.g. \[\[not a link\]\]
 
 
