4. CALLOUTS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  Syntax is a blockquote with a type marker on the first line.
 
    > [!note] Optional custom title
    > Body text. Callouts nest and can contain lists, code, links.
 
  Foldable variants:
    > [!tip]-  collapsed by default
    > [!tip]+  expanded by default, but collapsible
 
  Types (aliases in parens, they render identically):
    note
    abstract   (summary, tldr)
    info
    todo
    tip        (hint, important)
    success    (check, done)
    question   (help, faq)
    warning    (caution, attention)
    failure    (fail, missing)
    danger     (error)
    bug
    example
    quote      (cite)
 
  Nesting:
    > [!warning] Outer
    > > [!info] Inner
 
 
