6. TAGS
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  #tag                    inline anywhere in the body
  #parent/child/leaf      nested tags, filterable at any level
  tags: [a, b] in YAML    preferred for structured metadata
 
  Rules:
    - No spaces. Use - or _ or /
    - Cannot be purely numeric (#2026 is invalid, #y2026 is fine)
    - Case-insensitive for matching, but the first-used casing sticks
 
  Tags vs links vs folders:
    folders  one home per note, physical
    tags     many-to-many state/type labels (#status/active, #type/runbook)
    links    relationships between specific things
 
  Tag pane (core plugin) lists all tags with counts.
 
 
