7. SEARCH QUERY SYNTAX
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  Ctrl+Shift+F opens global search.
 
    word1 word2         both must appear (implicit AND)
    "exact phrase"      literal phrase
    word1 OR word2      either
    -word               exclude
    (a OR b) -c         grouping
 
    file:runbook        filename contains
    path:projects/nas   path contains
    content:acl         body text only
    tag:#lab            has tag
    line:(nfs acl)      both terms on the SAME line
    block:(a b)         both terms in the same block
    section:(a b)       both terms under the same heading
    task:(deploy)       matches any task line
    task-todo:(deploy)  unchecked tasks only
    task-done:(deploy)  checked tasks only
 
    match-case:Foo      force case sensitivity
    ignore-case:foo     force case insensitivity
    /^\d{4}-\d{2}/      regex, wrapped in slashes
 
  Embed a live search in a note:
    ```query
    tag:#lab -path:archive
    ```
 
 
