9. TEMPLATES + DAILY NOTES
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  Core Templates plugin. Set a template folder in settings, then insert
  with Ctrl+P > "Insert template".
 
  Core template variables:
    {{title}}                   note filename
    {{date}}                    current date, default format
    {{time}}                    current time
    {{date:YYYY-MM-DD}}         custom format (Moment.js tokens)
    {{time:HH:mm}}
 
  Daily Notes plugin: set date format, folder, and template. Bind
  "Open today's note" to a hotkey.
 
  For anything more (prompts, JS, file moves, dynamic frontmatter) use
  the Templater community plugin:
    <% tp.date.now("YYYY-MM-DD") %>
    <% tp.file.title %>
    <% tp.system.prompt("Project name?") %>
 
 
