12. DATAVIEW QUICK REFERENCE
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  Table:
    ```dataview
    TABLE status, file.mtime AS "Modified"
    FROM #lab AND -"archive"
    WHERE status = "active"
    SORT file.mtime DESC
    LIMIT 20
    ```
 
  List:
    ```dataview
    LIST FROM "projects" WHERE contains(tags, "poc")
    ```
 
  Tasks:
    ```dataview
    TASK FROM #project WHERE !completed
    ```
 
  Inline field syntax in a note body:
    status:: active
    owner:: [[Steve]]
 
  Inline query:
    `= this.file.name`
    `= date(today) - this.date`
 
  Sources for FROM:
    #tag          "folder"        [[note]]        outgoing([[note]])
    Combine with AND / OR / -
 
 
