13. VAULT ON DISK / GIT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  <vault>/
    .obsidian/
      app.json           editor + general settings
      appearance.json    theme, font
      hotkeys.json       your keybinds
      core-plugins.json
      community-plugins.json
      workspace.json     open panes/tabs -- churns constantly
      plugins/           installed plugin code
      themes/
      snippets/          your own CSS, toggled in Settings > Appearance
    Attachments/         default attachment folder (configurable)
    *.md
 
  Suggested .gitignore:
    .obsidian/workspace.json
    .obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
    .obsidian/cache
    .trash/
    .DS_Store
 
  Commit .obsidian/ minus workspace files if you want settings synced
  across machines. Exclude the whole .obsidian/ if you want each device
  independent.
 
  Because it is all plain files, this works fine:
    rg -n "cloudpools" ~/vault
    fd -e md . ~/vault | wc -l
    git -C ~/vault log --oneline -- "Runbooks/XCP.md"
 
 
