14. URI SCHEME
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 
  obsidian://open?vault=MyVault&file=Folder%2FNote
  obsidian://new?vault=MyVault&name=Scratch&content=hello
  obsidian://search?vault=MyVault&query=tag%3A%23lab
 
  Useful for launcher scripts, Alfred/Raycast, or shell aliases.
 
 
